### Register family
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register-family
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyName": "Muller",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Muller"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "anna@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}
